{{apichanges|10.2.5|prev=10.2.0|next=10.2.6}}

==Summary==
* Added a new animation type for animating changes to texture vertex colors. See [[#Vertex color animations|Vertex color animations]].
* The color picker frame has been reworked. See [[#Color picker changes|Color picker changes]].
* The ping system has had a convenience template added for making pingable unit frames, and a few API restrictions relaxed. See [[#Ping system changes|Ping system changes]].
* Various functions for querying buffs and debuffs have been deprecated and will be removed in the following expansion. Notably, this includes {{api|UnitAura}}, {{api|UnitBuff}}, and {{api|UnitDebuff}}.

